    I've done it, and I'm sure a lot of other people did it in the
 past.  You could run something 'forever' on it, though it
 wouldn't be the best choice for high-performance, heavily-used
 programs.

> 2. Does Vax11-RSX come part-n-parcel with VMS? If not, I probably can't afford
