 dwing@uh01.Colorado.EDU (Dan Wing) writes:
> In article <12OCT199310461481@vx.cis.umn.edu>, tkennedy writes:
> 
>>Is there an advantage in response to using the Decservers with modem control
>>(Decsvr 200, I think) instead of the ones without (Decsvr 100, I think)?
