On October 12, along with new product announcements, DEC altered the
prices for almost everything they sell. In a nutshell, list prices
were lowered to be closer to "street prices", and many large discounts
went away.

Here are LIST prices for Alpha 3000 300 and 400 System Building Block
(SBB)  and  Packaged Systems (PKG), as best I can determine. Old
prices are from old DEC quotes, before discounts. New prices are from the
Estore today. This is with no extras.
The only difference between the SBB and the PKG is a VRT19 monitor and 
a 1 GB RZ26. 

               SBB         PKG         SBB         PKG
               PE300-PA    PE301-PD    PE400-EA    PE401-NA
Old Price      7,495       12,995      14,000      18,795
