To see what 'consistency' means try as an exercise to write U**X equivalens
of the following VMS commands:

DIR
DIR *.H
DIR *.DIR
DIR [.PROGRAMS]
DIR [.*]
DIR [...]
DIR [-...]text.*
DIR NODEB::DUB0:[USER...]PROGRAM.C

And count how many different programs and different options to those programs
you needed. Note that I didn't use ANY option to DIR - If I used, I could
do much much more... And if I used logicals - hoho ;-)

