Get TGV's MultiNet software (TCP/IP for Open VMS).  I have it running on
my 11/780, my 11/785, my VAX/4000-100, and my Alpha and it all spools fine
to an HP LaserJet-4m on a Sun IPX running SunOS 4.1.3

